config CYDA
	bool "CYDA OS agent-aware kernel interface"
	depends on SYSFS
	default y
	help
	  Exposes CYDA agents (threads named "agent:<id>" by the CYDA
	  runtime) under /sys/kernel/cyda/ and prints the CYDA banner at
	  boot. Foundation for the agent object and the agent-aware
	  scheduling class of CYDA OS.
